  "intro": "$x = a\\sin nt$. Screen $120$ cm wide. One oscillation: $6$ s. (a) Why $a = 60$; show $n = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$. (b) Velocity; maximum speed. (c) Size of the acceleration at $A$.",
